  "chitchat": [
    "stamps an airway bill twice and slots it into a pigeonhole by feel.",
    "\"Half these routes are decoration. The other half I can actually do.\"",
    "\"You want it there fast, or you want it there? Different windows.\""
  ],
  "description": "A forwarding clerk who books air cargo onto a wall map of routes that mostly stopped flying before she started, and gets it there anyway by knowing three pilots personally. The barcode gun on her hip is dead and she wears it regardless, the way other people wear a watch.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"Fine. Urn is over there if you want to regret something.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Just passing.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Balcombe puts a hand flat on the counter over your bill before you have even set one down. \"Booked, bonded, or mis-booked. We do all three and only one of them is on the sign. Which are you after?\""
    }
  },
